                                                "sense_id": "f8c7f431-9528-3019-b14b-ac7ae9d4dc8c",
                                                "text": "But what he did not respect, gangster-wise or otherwise but no wise, was that part of the pie that belonged to his uncles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84a53663-9362-435c-876c-f7ebcbcd0077",
                                                "sense_id": "f8c7f431-9528-3019-b14b-ac7ae9d4dc8c",
                                                "text": "I wasn't cuttin' much of a figure, gangsterwise."
